S2DEX object rectangles: G_OBJ_RECTANGLE and the rectangle half of
G_OBJ_LDTX_RECT (warecomp STATUS.md round 6).

RT64 loaded the texture for G_OBJ_LDTX_RECT and then drew nothing (a TODO
and an assert that release builds compile out), and G_OBJ_RECTANGLE wasn't
mapped. Worms Armageddon draws every worm with G_OBJ_LDTX_RECT, so they
were invisible.

doObjRectangle sets the render tile from the uObjSprite (format, size,
TMEM line and address, palette; clamped unless G_OBJRM_NOTXCLAMP), and
draws one texture rectangle at objX, objY, imageW x imageH texels divided
by the scale, flipped in S or T per G_OBJ_FLAG_FLIPS/FLIPT, with copy
mode's inclusive lower right edge. Rotated and matrix sprites
(G_OBJ_SPRITE, G_OBJ_LDTX_SPRITE, the _R variants) are still not done.

